# Typography

Set text in Arial, then Helvetica, then the system sans-serif font. Do not name GDS Transport anywhere in the font stack. The supplied civica lockup is artwork, not a font for interface text.


## Apply the type hierarchy

This page owns the sizes and the native Home Assistant density exception. [Typography in context](brand-typography.html) owns alignment, values, text scaling and print.


